(7702968, 1264811, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of the panoramic technique.  Id love to see this at a higher resolution.  Super entry.</td>', 'Excellent use of the panoramic technique.  Id love to see this at a higher resolution.  Super entry.', '2021-10-08 14:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702971, 1264832, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent, although the foreground distortion is a bit funky. 9, nonetheless.</td>', 'Excellent, although the foreground distortion is a bit funky. 9, nonetheless.', '2021-10-08 14:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702984, 1264841, 35086, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky!  I would have liked to see that pier serve more as a leading line as it is a little flat shot this way but still very very nice!</td>', 'Lovely sky!  I would have liked to see that pier serve more as a leading line as it is a little flat shot this way but still very very nice!', '2021-10-08 22:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702985, 1264840, 35086, '<td valign="top">Cool shot but there are so many elements I''m not exactly sure what to look at.  Nothing really makes me explore the frame either.  But interesting nonetheless.</td>', 'Cool shot but there are so many elements I''m not exactly sure what to look at.  Nothing really makes me explore the frame either.  But interesting nonetheless.', '2021-10-08 22:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702987, 1264728, 35086, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a beautiful view for sure!<br/> <br/>As for the title, I get what you''re trying to achieve here but the restaurant is so hidden and so off to the side that it barely feels like an element in the shot.  We''re also not really seeing what the restaurant is seeing, but rather the view to the side of it.  Also, the foreground isn''t very necessary, might have been a good idea to crop that right out, it would have been the perfect challenge to do so.</td>', 'That''s quite a beautiful view for sure! As for the title, I get what you''re trying to achieve here but the restaurant is so hidden and so off to the side that it barely feels like an element in the shot.  We''re also not really seeing what the restaurant is seeing, but rather the view to the side of it.  Also, the foreground isn''t very necessary, might have been a good idea to crop that right out, it would have been the perfect challenge to do so.', '2021-10-08 22:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702988, 1264838, 35086, '<td valign="top">That is so interesting, and the colors are very interesting as well!   I love the sun going down, the slight lens flare and the rays still touching some of those trees beyond the swamp.  Very well done!</td>', 'That is so interesting, and the colors are very interesting as well!   I love the sun going down, the slight lens flare and the rays still touching some of those trees beyond the swamp.  Very well done!', '2021-10-08 22:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702989, 1264839, 35086, '<td valign="top">That is such a cool view, I''m definitely going to check that out on wikipedia now! hehe.  Well captured.</td>', 'That is such a cool view, I''m definitely going to check that out on wikipedia now! hehe.  Well captured.', '2021-10-08 22:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702990, 1264811, 35086, '<td valign="top">Just wow.  The long exposure just really lights up those highway which just looks like a really cool racetrack.  The clouds, the city lights, everything is just absolutely lovely here.  Top marks here.</td>', 'Just wow.  The long exposure just really lights up those highway which just looks like a really cool racetrack.  The clouds, the city lights, everything is just absolutely lovely here.  Top marks here.', '2021-10-08 22:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702991, 1264715, 35086, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a sky!  Very nice!</td>', 'Wow, what a sky!  Very nice!', '2021-10-08 22:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702993, 1264830, 35086, '<td valign="top">I like that this is vertical, it''s definitely different than the other entries so far!  However, there''s not much going on, or at least I''m not exactly sure what I should be looking at.</td>', 'I like that this is vertical, it''s definitely different than the other entries so far!  However, there''s not much going on, or at least I''m not exactly sure what I should be looking at.', '2021-10-08 22:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702994, 1264826, 35086, '<td valign="top">I definitely love that the focus in on this beautiful sky.  The only part I''m not crazy about are the elements at the bottom of the frame, perhaps arranged in a different way it could have been interesting, but this way, those things just feel like distractions.  Still lovely!</td>', 'I definitely love that the focus in on this beautiful sky.  The only part I''m not crazy about are the elements at the bottom of the frame, perhaps arranged in a different way it could have been interesting, but this way, those things just feel like distractions.  Still lovely!', '2021-10-08 22:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702995, 1264526, 35086, '<td valign="top">I love old things, certainly old rusted tractors!  So much character.  I find there is a bit too much foreground here but it''s still nice!</td>', 'I love old things, certainly old rusted tractors!  So much character.  I find there is a bit too much foreground here but it''s still nice!', '2021-10-08 22:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702996, 1264678, 35086, '<td valign="top">This is different and very cool!  The length of the frame really offers a sense of direction.  Love the colors, and that hint of blue.   Very cool.</td>', 'This is different and very cool!  The length of the frame really offers a sense of direction.  Love the colors, and that hint of blue.   Very cool.', '2021-10-08 22:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702998, 1264754, 35086, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been to a stadium this big, I''m not the biggest sports fan but I absolutely love pictures as such and you''ve captured this one very well.  I love the fact that all the eyes of most of these people is right on the field, on that tiny ball!  Can''t really do better at putting focus on one single subject! Very nice capture!</td>', 'I''ve never been to a stadium this big, I''m not the biggest sports fan but I absolutely love pictures as such and you''ve captured this one very well.  I love the fact that all the eyes of most of these people is right on the field, on that tiny ball!  Can''t really do better at putting focus on one single subject! Very nice capture!', '2021-10-08 22:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702999, 1264526, 42495, '<td valign="top">I really like this. If it were me, I''d crop off about half of the green on the bottom to give it more of a panoramic look.</td>', 'I really like this. If it were me, I''d crop off about half of the green on the bottom to give it more of a panoramic look.', '2021-10-08 23:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
