(7703450, 1264811, 67145, '<td valign="top">many congratulations Lev on an amazing image and the blue .. <br/>and thankyou for the backstory .. even tho I didn''t understand this bit .. <i>"This is a 26-frame 360 deg. "spherical" panorama</i>"<br/>which is ok .. I understood the rest ..!!.. <br/> <br/></td>', 'many congratulations Lev on an amazing image and the blue .. and thankyou for the backstory .. even tho I didn''t understand this bit .. "This is a 26-frame 360 deg. "spherical" panorama"which is ok .. I understood the rest ..!!..  ', '2021-10-15 06:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7703460, 1264811, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> many congratulations Lev on an amazing image and the blue .. <br/>and thankyou for the backstory .. even tho I didn''t understand this bit .. <i>"This is a 26-frame 360 deg. "spherical" panorama</i>"<br/>which is ok .. I understood the rest ..!!.. </i></td></tr></table> Thank you Roz! Well, "spherical" is the name that my drone has for this type of panorama. In reality, it is only hemi-spherical: its 26 frames cover full 360 deg horizontally but only the bottom 180 deg. The drone camera only can tilt down, but not up.</td>', 'Originally posted by roz: many congratulations Lev on an amazing image and the blue .. and thankyou for the backstory .. even tho I didn''t understand this bit .. "This is a 26-frame 360 deg. "spherical" panorama"which is ok .. I understood the rest ..!!..  Thank you Roz! Well, "spherical" is the name that my drone has for this type of panorama. In reality, it is only hemi-spherical: its 26 frames cover full 360 deg horizontally but only the bottom 180 deg. The drone camera only can tilt down, but not up.', '2021-10-15 13:03:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7703461, 1264811, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is totally brilliant, Lev! Congrats!</td>', 'This is totally brilliant, Lev! Congrats!', '2021-10-15 13:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7703466, 1264838, 30214, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, Robert, must be even much better in a big size! The inherent problem with panoramic shots they don''t look very good in web-size presentation.  Congrats on Top10! Looks like the same type of panorama as my shot in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, Robert, must be even much better in a big size! The inherent problem with panoramic shots they don''t look very good in web-size presentation.  Congrats on Top10! Looks like the same type of panorama as my shot in this challenge.', '2021-10-15 14:04:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7703480, 1264754, 30214, '<td valign="top">Aren''t modern cell phones great? They make panoramas so well, and so easy! Congrats on your ribbon, nice shot!</td>', 'Aren''t modern cell phones great? They make panoramas so well, and so easy! Congrats on your ribbon, nice shot!', '2021-10-15 17:52:12.000000', NULL, 0),
